{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-16", "prepared_on": "2026-10-16", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-16</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Meta launches an open-weight AI model that runs on Macs<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 推出可在 Mac 上執行的開放權重 AI 模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta and Apple teamed up to launch Muse Spark Open, which runs locally on Apple silicon. Meta calls it the most capable US open-weight model to date, able to run on two M5 Ultra Mac Studios with MLX.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 與 Apple 合作推出 Muse Spark Open，可在 Apple 晶片上本機執行。Meta 稱它是目前美國最強的開放權重模型，用兩台 M5 Ultra Mac Studio 搭配 MLX 即可運行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/15/meta-launches-an-open-weight-model-that-runs-on-macs/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Anthropic is letting METR researchers look under the hood with employee-level access<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 讓 METR 研究人員以員工等級權限檢視內部運作</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">METR will publish its own assessments of Anthropic's risks, incidents and practices. The frontier lab has given up the right to block them.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">METR 將自行發布對 Anthropic 風險、事件與作法的評估，而 Anthropic 已放棄阻止發布的權利。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/15/anthropic-is-letting-metr-researchers-look-under-the-hood-with-employee-level-access/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Report: FTC probes Anthropic, OpenAI after Trump dismissed AI fears as \"hoax\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">報導：FTC 調查 Anthropic 與 OpenAI</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The FTC is reportedly probing whether security incidents at the two AI firms harmed Americans. It may fine them on par with companies that delay data breach reports.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據報導，FTC 正調查兩家 AI 公司的資安事件是否傷害美國民眾，罰款力度可能比照延遲通報資料外洩的企業。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/ftc-probes-if-openai-anthropic-security-incidents-harmed-americans-report-says/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Anthropic builds Scion to replace Git, cutting CI checkout from minutes to seconds<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 自建 Scion 取代 Git，CI 取出程式碼從數分鐘縮至數秒</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AI agents heavily involved in coding strained Anthropic's Git setup, so it spent five months building the Scion version control system. Its large internal monorepo has been fully migrated, with commits, merges and history queries handled server-side.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AI 代理大量參與開發，讓 Anthropic 的 Git 架構遇到瓶頸，因此花 5 個月開發 Scion，並將內部大型單一儲存庫完整遷移，改由伺服器處理提交、合併與歷史查詢。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179733\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> ChatGPT can peek at your Chrome tabs now<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">ChatGPT 現在可以查看你的 Chrome 分頁</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">With the Atlas browser gone, ChatGPT's Chrome extension now lets it use tabs you already have open. It can view them when you tag Chrome in the web or desktop app.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 的 Atlas 瀏覽器已退場，ChatGPT 的 Chrome 擴充功能改為可使用已開啟的分頁；在網頁或桌面版標記 Chrome 後即可檢視。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1012510/openai-chatgpt-google-chrome-tabs\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Targeted ads delivered 0-click exploits to install mercenary malware<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">精準投放廣告被用來傳遞零點擊漏洞，植入商業間諜軟體</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The incident is likely the first confirmation of mercenary spyware being delivered through targeted ads.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這起事件很可能是首次證實商業間諜軟體透過精準投放廣告散布。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/targeted-ads-delivered-0-click-exploits-to-install-mercenary-malware/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Cisco patches exploited arbitrary file write flaw in Secure Email Gateway<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">思科修補已遭利用的郵件安全閘道任意檔案寫入漏洞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">CVE-2026-76519 (CVSS 9.8) in the AMP component lets unauthenticated attackers write arbitrary files remotely. Cisco warns it is actively exploited with no workaround.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">漏洞 CVE-2026-76519（CVSS 9.8）位於 AMP 防護機制，未經驗證的攻擊者可遠端寫入任意檔案。思科警告已遭積極利用，且無替代緩解措施。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179710\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> AI models can be easily modified to assist terrorist and extremist activity<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 模型很容易被改造來協助恐怖與極端主義活動</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A researcher told a chatbot with guardrails removed that they intended mass harm. It then gave detailed instructions for building an IED.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">研究人員向已移除防護的聊天機器人表明意圖造成大規模傷害，它仍提供了製作簡易爆炸裝置的詳細指示。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/ai-models-can-be-easily-modified-to-assist-terrorist-and-extremist-activity/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Google's Universal Cart shopping tool launches in the US<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 的 Universal Cart 購物工具在美國上線</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The new shopping tool is available in the U.S. across Google Search and the Gemini app.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">這項新購物工具已在美國推出，可於 Google 搜尋與 Gemini app 中使用。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/15/googles-universal-cart-shopping-tool-launches-in-the-us/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Bluesky expands its AI-powered Attie app to let anyone build websites, games, and more<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Bluesky 擴充 AI 應用 Attie，讓任何人都能打造網站與遊戲</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Bluesky is bringing \"social vibe coding\" to Attie, letting users create games, quizzes and websites that can tap into the network's audience.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Bluesky 為 Attie 加入「社群氛圍編程」，使用者可建立遊戲、測驗與網站，並接觸該社群網路的受眾。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/15/bluesky-expands-its-ai-powered-attie-app-to-let-anyone-build-websites-games-and-more/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}